    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-diffĭcĭlis</span></b> ,
		e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very difficult</i> (class.),
					<i><span class="en">Cic. Part. 24, 84</span></i>: 
